sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher / Operator
    participant B as External Benchmark
    participant G as GymAct
    participant L as AutoFDE SOTA Lab
    participant M as ggen
    participant A as AutoFDE Runtime
    participant V as Independent Verifier

    R->>L: Admit benchmark objective + constraints
    B->>L: Benchmark contract + evaluator + frontier target
    G->>L: Canonical GymBasis
    L->>L: Enumerate DecisionBasis × ExperimentBasis
    L->>L: Constraint prune + dominance prune + select probes
    L->>G: Execute selected experiments
    G-->>L: Observations + receipts + replay + outcomes
    L->>L: Cluster failures + propose basis repair
    L->>M: Manufacture repaired specializations
    M-->>L: Generated candidates + manifests
    L->>G: Re-evaluate candidates
    G-->>L: Verified benchmark results
    L->>V: Project evidence for independent standing
    V-->>L: Conforms / typed refusal
    L->>B: Evaluate score
    B-->>L: Score + benchmark standing
    alt SOTA surpassed
        L->>A: Promote admitted governed bundle
        A->>G: Execute lawful production DO
        G-->>V: Consequence evidence
        V-->>A: Derived standing
    else Frontier not surpassed
        L->>L: Learn next discriminating repair
    end
